fixture mend_chains_while_held
doc docs/adr/0013, Mend: still held at the end of a channel, with the Flame and a heart to heal, the next Mend starts at once.
room test/flat
option flame 66
option hearts 3
frames 110
input
  0..105 mend
end
expect
  at 49 hearts=4 flame=33
  at 50 spell=mend flame=0
  at 99 hearts=5
end
